From: coupling-test <coupling-test@local>
Subject: [PATCH] Accept any Zephyr SDK version in FindHostTools

ZSWatch pins Zephyr v4.3.x which requests SDK version 0.16 via
find_package(Zephyr-sdk 0.16). SDK 1.0.1 registers as version 1.0.1
which fails this version check. Remove the version constraint so that
SDK 1.0.1 is accepted.
---
 zephyr/cmake/modules/FindHostTools.cmake | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/zephyr/cmake/modules/FindHostTools.cmake b/zephyr/cmake/modules/FindHostTools.cmake
index fbb09ad4883..897e5f41b72 100644
--- a/zephyr/cmake/modules/FindHostTools.cmake
+++ b/zephyr/cmake/modules/FindHostTools.cmake
@@ -48,7 +48,7 @@ if(HostTools_FOUND)
   return()
 endif()
 
-find_package(Zephyr-sdk 0.16)
+find_package(Zephyr-sdk)
 
 # gperf is an optional dependency
 find_program(GPERF gperf)